  "Description": "The Continue goal is designed to resume execution of a process. It first checks if debugging is active by evaluating the \\%debugActive\\% variable. If \\%debugActive\\% is not true, the goal will terminate early without performing any further actions. If debugging is active, it proceeds to write a command to continue execution to the debug channel.",
